interface.longDescription:
getfund helps startup founders apply to accelerators, grants and other startup programs from ChatGPT and Codex. Sign in with your getfund account to:

- see what your company brain (your startup's facts, answers and documents) still misses, and fill the gaps by answering questions;
- search getfund's catalog of open programs by name, organiser, sector, stage or country, with the deadline, the apply-link status and your fit score;
- add the programs you name to your queue, start an application and save answers in the form's own language;
- record a submission with its proof, or report a broken apply link, a login wall or a captcha.

getfund never submits a program's form by itself and records a submission only after you confirm it. In ChatGPT getfund reads your brain and queue, finds programs and prepares the answers, and you submit on the program's site; filling the form in a browser happens in Codex with a browser tool.
